{"ID":"20240511110600-g4nqnr7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110600-g4nqnr7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110600-g4nqnr7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511112238-6avzoic\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511131031-fzblgzw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513125039-8g83vmk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:46,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:46\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-018号（腰蛇胸蛇颈蛇主之）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513125040"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511112238-6avzoic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-6avzoic","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此类皮肤疾病中医称为 \"腰蛇\" \"胸蛇\" \"颈蛇\" , 表面上看起来呈现一粒粒的粉红色小水泡 , 形成如带状的漫延 , 非常疼痛 , 一般来说此痛是连止痛药都无法止的 , 过去我国谣传如果环身一圈就会致命 , 实际不会如此 , 只是会令人痛不欲生 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-xuawlxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-xuawlxl","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西医认为并无任何西药可以治疗此病 ,因为是滤过性病毒引起的 , 所以只有开止痛药 , 来缓和症状 , 而中国人在千年前已经解决了此一问题 , 我们有三种方式可以解决此一病情 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-bayma2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-bayma2z","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一 : 内服单味中药(处方保留)来止痛 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-278jc37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-278jc37","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二 : 外用汉唐18号来镇痛收敛 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-9r9n2ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-9r9n2ih","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三 : 用针灸来治 , 效果最快 , 约五天就可以好 , 因为须专门技术 , 我无法在此说明 , 很抱歉 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-s236dy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-s236dy3","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐18号是外用药粉 , 直接敷药到泡疹上面 , 一日贰次 , 敷好以後就用纱布包在外面 , 直到收口为止 , 一般须要连续使用二星期以上 , 才会好转. 如果没有进步就须找优秀的中医师 , 用针灸来治 , 一般而言 , 此病愈後极佳 , 通常不会再犯 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-xi5npgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-xi5npgi","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方内容 : 青黛 , ................."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-omii8fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-omii8fw","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁 忌 : 无 . 惟不可内服 , 如不幸误服 , 多饮冷水即可 . 因此药完全无毒 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511112238-cuejyu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112238-cuejyu3","updated":"20240511112238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"副作用 : 无 . 无须医师处方 , 任何人皆可以使用 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511131029-e6x6gxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131029-e6x6gxl"}},{"ID":"20240513125039-8g83vmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513125039-8g83vmk","updated":"20240513125040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中醫名腰蛇 , 胸蛇 , 頸蛇 (如同西醫名帶狀泡疹)外敷用，類似於仙豐製作的活力敏18號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131030-qas09ys","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511131030-qas09ys"}},{"ID":"20240511131031-hr0y3e7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-hr0y3e7","updated":"20240511131034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-18  腰蛇胸蛇颈蛇"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-n5kxgpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-n5kxgpm","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.11.20B　录校：徐荣霞）"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-6cwxdjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-6cwxdjq","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们看原文："}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-jyu3vd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-jyu3vd7","updated":"20240511150347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":".此类皮肤疾病中医称为\u0026quot;腰蛇\u0026quot;\u0026quot;胸蛇\u0026quot;\u0026quot;颈蛇\u0026quot;，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-vqndvxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-vqndvxn","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样的病症不可长对头，一长对头人就要死，比如说腰蛇这个地方它就是顺带脉去长，也就是说从这个带状疱疹所发的基本路线观察下，基本上是顺着经络发展的，它是有一定的道路的。不是随便就能生出疱疹的，象腰蛇疮就是顺带脉长的。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-xtrw5i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-xtrw5i5","updated":"20240511150349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表面上看起来呈现一粒粒的粉红色小水泡，形成如带状的漫延，非常疼痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-0g230b5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-0g230b5","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"带状疱疹的疼痛是很厉害的，别说碰一下，不碰它就特别的疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-7rc5a6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-7rc5a6d","updated":"20240511150352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般来说此痛是连止痛药都无法止的，过去我国谣传如果环身一圈就会致命，实际不会如此，只是会令人痛不欲生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-tiok4mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-tiok4mz","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是倪海厦所说的，本门里面的论述还是缠一圈后长对头之后就要人性命，特别是腰蛇疮，如果要是长对头了，是要人性命的。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-t26xw5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-t26xw5u","updated":"20240511150359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"西医认为并无任何西药可以治疗此病，因为是滤过性病毒引起的，所以只有开止痛药，来缓和症状，而中国人在千年前已经解决了此一问题，我们有三种方式可以解决此一病情。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-81csu4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-81csu4n","updated":"20240511150400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一:内服单味中药(处方保留)来止痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-dqgnl8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-dqgnl8x","updated":"20240511150401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二:外用汉唐18号来镇痛收敛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-osszg8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-osszg8n","updated":"20240511150401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三:用针灸来治，效果最快，约五天就可以好，因为须专门技术，我无法在此说明，很抱歉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-7kvize9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-7kvize9","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用针灸治疗此病确实是很快，本来这病是顺经络长的，用针灸调其精气，治疗是很快的"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-6vf8dud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-6vf8dud","updated":"20240511150410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"汉唐18号是一种外用药粉，可以直接敷药到泡疹上面，一日贰次，敷好以后就用纱布包在外面，直到收口为止，一般须要连续使用二星期以上，才会好转。如果没有进步就须找优秀的中医师，用针灸来治，一般而言，此病愈后极佳，通常不会再犯。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-603xejq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-603xejq","updated":"20240511150412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方内容：青黛……"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-y53kmup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-y53kmup","updated":"20240511150413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"禁忌 : 无 .   惟不可内服 , 如不幸误服 , 多饮冷水即可 . 因此药完全无毒 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131031-fzblgzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131031-fzblgzw","updated":"20240511131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪海厦先生对内服的这一个药方，在保留阶段。内服的药方我给大家说一下如何内服这样的中药。它主要用的原理便是活血，通其经络而去其痰。要把这个毒解了，里面的痰就是毒，要把这个毒解了，要通其经络，进行养血活血而去其里面的痰。这是属于内服药物，外用药呢？这个倪海厦只说了一味青黛，外用药一般用一些毒药效果属于是比较好的，目前是没办法说这一味药，针灸的治疗属于是比较好的。今天就讲到汉唐18号，好，下课。"}]}]}